WEBVTT

00:03:59.151 --> 00:04:01.779
So I borrowed from
my music-listening brain,

00:04:01.779 --> 00:04:04.865
and now when I’m in a conversation,
this is what I try to do.

00:04:06.117 --> 00:04:07.493
Be open to new ideas.

00:04:08.828 --> 00:04:10.079
Stop multitasking.

00:04:11.289 --> 00:04:13.958
Let the other person know
that you’re engaged,

00:04:14.000 --> 00:04:18.129
and do it without taking your focus away
from them and turning it onto you.

00:04:19.005 --> 00:04:20.631
Because of making "Song Exploder,"

00:04:20.673 --> 00:04:25.011
I now listen to a much wider
range of music than I used to.

00:04:25.052 --> 00:04:26.304
When I was younger,

00:04:26.345 --> 00:04:29.181
I used to actually pride myself
on my music snobbery.